#
# WARNING: A pattern like ".env" will only match env files in the root, not in subdirectories.
#          As this is a monorepo, always use patterns like "**/.env".
#

# Node dependencies
**/node_modules
**/package-lock.json

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/.fleet
**/.idea

# Local env files
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/!.env.example

# Nuxt/Nitro
**/.output
**/.data
**/.nuxt
**/.nitro
**/.cache
**/dist

# Storybook
**/storybook-static
**/*storybook.log

# Test coverage
**/coverage

# Temporary files
**/tmp

# Turborepo
**/.turbo

# TypeScript
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Rollup
**/.rollup.cache

# Git
**/.github
**/.gitignore